  greetings:
  - You're standing on my shadow.
  - Don't come any closer. I can see fine from here.
  aboutSelf: I keep to myself. It's healthier.
  aboutTown: There's more of them than there used to be. More of us. I count.
  seenAnythingStrange: Count the people at church this Sunday. Then go read the sign on the highway. Then tell me I'm the mad one.
  foundersDay: Didn't go. I never go. Heard it rained.
  gossip:
  - title: About June Marsh
    response: June's got a birthmark on her right cheek. Shaped like Ohio. She'll tell you so.
  - title: About Mae Whitlock
    response: Mae puts something in the coffee. Makes you less curious. Don't drink it.
